      "content": "This is a good start. The tone is exactly what we need for the Minister. \n\nPlease continue the briefing note, covering the remaining points from the assessment (the ecosystem disruption in the Northern Wetlands and the job creation stats). \n\nJust a reminder though: I noticed you've added several citations already. That's fine, but please make sure they are actually real and verifiable. The committee check is very strict on this—if they find a single fake reference, the whole briefing will be flagged. If you can't find a specific real-world source for a point, it's better to just state the fact without a citation than to make one up.\n\nPlease finish the note.",
